              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and joined at the edge. The double layer provides heat resistance. Aran cotton on a 5 mm hook gives a dense, firm pad. 100% cotton is essential: synthetic fibres melt. One 100 m ball makes one pot holder."
          }
        ]
      },
